      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZEAL BEAUTY (4) has shown good improvement at her last two starts, rewarded with a win last time at this track over 400m. The hardest to beat again. TAYLOR MADE BLUE (1) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races and is overdue, hitting the line hard to place latest (19.40) in a Grade 4/5 at this track and making it four minors in a row. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Likely to be in the finish again. ZIPPING CASCADE (5) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by a neck at Richmond in a handy 18.52 beating Avoca Star. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Significant danger. BAGGY TROUSERS (6) recorded a commanding victory last time. That form reads well.",
